---
import learning from '../data/learning.json';
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
import Filters from '../components/Filters.astro';
import HowItWorks from '../components/HowItWorks.astro';
import '../styles/app.css';
import { packs } from '../data/content.json';
const entries=packs;
const topics=[...new Set(entries.map(item=>item.topic))];
const ages=[...new Set(entries.map(item=>item.age))];
---
<Shell title="Family Halaqa"><script is:inline>document.querySelector('main')?.setAttribute('data-projector','')</script><section class="intro"><div class="intro-text"><h1 class="editorial">{learning.heading}</h1> <p>Short packs to do together. No names or profiles needed.</p> <span class="pill neutral count-chip">{entries.length} packs</span></div><img class="motif" src="/motif.svg" alt="" width="220" height="140" aria-hidden="true"/></section><div class="workspace"><div class="library"><Filters topics={topics} ages={ages}/><div class="collection-tools"><h2 id="entries">Choose a pack</h2> <div class="actions"><button class="button secondary" id="copy-saved">Copy my list</button> <button class="button secondary" id="print-saved" type="button">Print saved packs</button></div></div> <div class="card-grid">{entries.map(item=><><article class="panel activity-card" data-item-id={item.id} data-search={`${item.title} ${item.topic} ${item.discussion}`} data-topic={item.topic} data-age={item.age}><span class="eyebrow">{item.topic}</span> <h2><a data-reading-link={item.id} href={`/pack/${item.id}/`}>{item.title}</a></h2> <p>{item.discussion}</p> <span class="micro">{`${(item as {passage?:{ref:string}}).passage?`Quran ${(item as {passage:{ref:string}}).passage.ref} · `:''}Read, talk, try · ${item.age} · ${item.minutes} minutes`}</span> <div class="actions"><a class="button" href={`/pack/${item.id}/`}>Open pack</a> <button class="button secondary" data-save={item.id} aria-pressed="false">Save</button></div></article>{' '}</>)}</div> <div id="empty" class="empty" hidden><h2>No packs match</h2> <p>Try fewer words, change a filter, or turn off “Saved only.”</p></div></div><aside class="sidebar"><HowItWorks>{' '}<p>Choose a pack with one reading question, an open conversation and a shared activity. About 10–15 minutes. Everyone may pass. Print a pack or use one shared screen, or press Projector for large text.</p><p>Age bands are suggestions. An adult can read aloud or adapt the vocabulary. Keep examples fictional; nobody needs to share a private story.</p><p>Save the packs you like, then use “Print saved packs” for one print view of all of them.</p></HowItWorks></aside></div><div id="saved-print" class="saved-print" aria-hidden="true"></div><script>import "../lib/library";</script></Shell>